      "title": "Fredun Pharmaceuticals Limited Approves Appointment of Pooja Narendra Sanghavi as Non-Executive Independent Director, Effective November 28, 2025",
      "body": "Fredun Pharmaceuticals Limited announced that based on the approval of the members of the company in the Extra-Ordinary General Meeting held February 16, 2026 have approved the appointment of Mrs. Pooja Narendra Sanghavi as the Non-Executive Independent Director of the Company for a term of Five-years with effect from November 28, 2025 to November 27, 2030. CS Pooja Narendra Sanghavi is a highly experienced and qualified Company Secretary and Compliance Officer. She has demonstrated expertise in Corporate Law, the Companies Act, 2013, and SEBI regulations, including the SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015, and SEBI (Prohibition of Insider Trading Regulations), 2015. Pooja's core competencies span convening and drafting minutes for Board, Committee, and General Meetings, annual and event-based fi",
