      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹22.19 (up from ₹11.29 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.61b (up 57% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹104.8m (up 97% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.5% (up from 5.2% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 39% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 21% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
